\f1\fs22 Chanta landed in much the same way a sack of overripe melons might. The momentum of his fall threw his head back, which collided with the suburban\'92s back window. He winced and rubbed the flowering bruise under his hair, and thus had no mind for who he was sharing the back seat with.\
